{
  "name": "dsh-workspace-color",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "DSH 侧边栏工作区层级配色：鼠标悬浮工作区行时出现颜料板图标，可从 12 个圆点预设（9 个统一明暗/饱和的色相 + 白/灰/黑）或系统取色器（默认按主题协调化）为单个工作区固定颜色；未指定的工作区按层级自动配色（同层同色、父子异色、色相自动避开背景）；当前会话标题标红；置顶图钉颜色可自定义。全部设置收进官方设置页的「侧边栏配色」分区。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "sidebar",
    "theme",
    "color",
    "oklch"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "check": "node scripts/build.mjs --check && node --check client.js"
  },
  "author": "Jikllji",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "install.ps1",
    "install.sh",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  }
}
